#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:5
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:7
msgid "Configuration vs runtime services"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:9
msgid "Config structs are declarative — strings, ints, bools only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:10
msgid "Never put runtime service instances inside a config struct."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:11
msgid "Pass runtime services directly as parameters to constructors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:13
msgid "Server types and the search service"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:15
msgid ""
"**`InMemoryServer`** (embedded in the plugin) takes `searchService "
"tools.SemanticSearchService` directly. The plugin passes "
"`*search.Search`, which implements `SemanticSearchService`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:16
msgid ""
"**HTTP / Stdio / PluginHandlers** (external servers) build their own "
"`HTTPSemanticSearchService` internally; that service calls back to the "
"plugin's `/api/v1/search/raw` endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:18
msgid "Type sharing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:20
msgid ""
"Do not duplicate types from the `search` package inside "
"`mcpserver/tools`. The `SemanticSearchService` interface uses "
"`search.Options` and `search.RAGResult` directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:21
msgid ""
"HTTP serialization DTOs (e.g., `httpSearchRequest`, `httpSearchResult` in"
" `search_http.go`) are intentionally separate from domain types and stay "
"in their respective files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:22
msgid ""
"If you only need a subset of fields, accept the full type and ignore the "
"unused fields rather than introducing a parallel struct."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:24
msgid "Adding a new optional capability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:26
msgid "Define the interface in `tools/`, reusing types from their source package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:27
msgid "For embedded servers: add the parameter to `NewInMemoryServer`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/mcpserver/AGENTS.md:28
msgid ""
"For external servers: add a plugin HTTP endpoint plus an HTTP client "
"implementation that calls it."
msgstr ""

